        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dinuclear Dy cluster showing SMM-type slow magnetic relaxation. χMT at 300 K is 26.5 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 28.3 for two uncoupled DyIII). χMT decreases to 22.1 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K; Weiss constant −1.6(3) K. Magnetization at 7 T is 10.6 Nβ. Under 2500 Oe DC field, frequency-dependent χM″ peaks are observed. Arrhenius fit: Ueff = 61(1) K, τ0 = 2.7×10−7 s; Orbach+Raman/direct fit: Ueff = 59(4) K, τ0 = 3.9(19)×10−7 s, C = 1.1(3) s−1 K−n, n = 2.3(3).",
